  "instrument": "Rigol DHO804, firmware 00.01.05, SCPI over raw TCP port 5555",
  "purpose": "Differential captures of the factory K-99695 Saturn valve buses at both valve connectors: idle, a controller start-up, and outlet starts and stops, plus the connectors' meter readings. See README.md.",
